      "name": "Load Pending Ideas",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "position": [
        -2352,
        -1600
      ],
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "notes": "GET /api/n8n/ai-studio/ideas?status=pending_review — validated by the same x-n8n-access-token / N8N_API_ACCESS_TOKEN mechanism as the existing 'Load Active Products' node (src/lib/n8n-auth.ts). Token is hardcoded to match every other workflow in this repo (they all send the literal 123456 and work against the deployed app). Do not switch to $env — n8n does not resolve $env in these workflows."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
