      "notes": "BLOCKER: chatId is a placeholder. Replace REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_CHAT_ID with the real admin Telegram chat id (seed it once from any inbound message.chat.id / callback_query.from.id on the existing bot). Until then this workflow cannot send. Keyboard uses the Telegram node's native replyMarkup:'inlineKeyboard' + inlineKeyboard.rows[].row.buttons[] shape, with callback_data under each button's additionalFields — verified against nodes-base Telegram.node.js and GenericFunctions.addAdditionalFields. Do NOT revert to a raw additionalFields.reply_markup object: it only survives because replyMarkup defaults to 'none' and the function returns before wiping body.reply_markup, and the n8n UI would strip it on any save. 4 buttons per automation-plan.md §6 (Edit/Regenerate out of scope). callback_data = ais:<action>:<ideaId>, matched by the 'Message Kind?' switch in telegram-fb-post-workflow.json."
    }
